z-López 1985: fig. 13). The Subbetic specimens are from the Laeviuscula Zone of JVM section (Cerro de la Martinica), Valdepeñas de Jaén, JST (Sierra del Trigo), JAC 3, JAC 3 ’, JAC 4, JAC 11 and JAC 22 (Sierra de Alta Coloma area) sections (Jaén Province).","","text","",""]]},"V4LWB":{"d":[["Fujian","","text","",""]]},"V64BM":{"d":[["Distribution. China, Sichuan Province, Meishan City.","","text","",""]]},"V7H7C":{"d":[["Kamchatka","47670","mrgid","",""]]},"V89H":{"d":[["Japan","","text","native",""],["North Korea","","text","native",""],["Russia","","text","native",""],["South Korea","","text","native",""]]},"V9745":{"d":[["Northern Ireland","48214","mrgid","",""]]},"VBQCC":{"d":[["French Guiana","","text","",""]]},"VC83K":{"d":[["NE-India (Nagaland)","","text","",""]]},"X5XJ":{"d":[["Australia (New South Wales)","","text","",""]]},"X9PN":{"d":[["Indonesia","","text","native",""]]},"XDYZ":{"d":[["SE-D.R.Congo [Zaire]; Tanzania; Angola; Zambia","","text","",""]]},"ZR8K":{"d":[["Soqotra","","text","",""]]}}